      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The documentation states that the \"Default is 0, so set this if you want to enable jump in your world. The default VRCWorld prefab sets this to 3.\"\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/players/player-forces/\n\nI would suggest simply waiting one frame before getting the value so you can be sure that the World Descriptor has had time to set the value first.\n\nIn my opinion this Canny should be closed.",
