      "value": "Thank you for the report! @{62df3a55f6fa434679f836fa|full_name} is correct: GetJumpImpulse correctly returns 0 because 0 is the default value.\n\nMost worlds use the Player Mod Setter prefab to override the default jump impulse. This may happen after the Start event.\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/examples/udon-example-scene/player-mod-setter",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
